---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#fff'
    primaryTextColor: '#000'
    primaryBorderColor: '#000'
    lineColor: '#000'
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start • Input Target])
    B[Collect Baseline] --> C{{For each fuzz payload}}

    C --> D[Run Heuristic Checks] --> E[Skor s]

    E -->|s < T_low| X[Discard & Next]

    %% ---------- Zona Tinggi ----------
    E -->|s > T_high| H[Light PoC Validation]
    H -->|PoC positif| L[High Confidence → Exploitation]
    H -->|PoC gagal| G[Send to LLM]

    %% ---------- Zona Ambigu ----------
    E -->|T_low ≤ s ≤ T_high| G

    %% ---------- LLM path ----------
    subgraph LLM
        G --> I[LLM 4-bit<br>max_tokens = 256]
        I --> J{{LLM verdict}}
    end

    %% ---------- Consensus ----------
    H -. "PoC gagal" .-> J
    J --> K{{Consensus Validator}}

    K -->|Tinggi| L
    K -->|Menengah| M[Manual Review List]
    K -->|Rendah| N[Ignore]

    %% ---------- Reporting ----------
    L --> R[Append to Report]
    M --> R
    N --> P[Log]

    C -->|loop| C